  "name": "Tomato Salsa",
  "text": "Tomato Salsa\n\nPreparation time: 10 minutes\n\nCooking time: 30 minutes (to combine)\n\nYield: 2\n\nPreparation\n\n1 vine tomatoes (de-seeded and chopped),\n\n1handful fresh basil leaves (torn),\n\n1 garlic clove (crushed to a paste with a knife),\n\n3tbsp olive oil,\n\n1 courgette (cut into ribbons with a potato peeler or mandolin),\n\n1 tbsp white wine vinegar,",
  "prepTime": "PT10M",
  "recipeYield": "2",
